  "Account": "账户",
  "Accounts that have deployed a personal Tau rule for their own money, such as a spending limit or a time-lock. The node folds all of them into one spec.": "为自己的资金部署了个人 Tau 规则的账户，例如消费限额或时间锁。节点把它们全部合并为一个规范。",
