  "Agreed rule change {a} of {b}: takes effect at block #{m}, in {n} blocks.": "已同意的规则变更（第 {a} 项，共 {b} 项）：在区块 #{m} 生效，还有 {n} 个区块。",
  "Agreed rule change {a} of {b}: takes effect at block #{n}, in {m} block{x}. Until then the old rules apply.": "已通过的规则变更（{b} 项中的第 {a} 项）：于区块 #{n} 生效，还有 {m} 个区块{x}。在此之前旧规则仍然适用。",
  "Agreed rule change: takes effect at block #{m}, in {n} block (about {x}).": "已同意的规则变更：在区块 #{m} 生效，还有 {n} 个区块（约 {x}）。",
