  "Agreed. Becomes law at #{m} ({n} blocks); nobody upgrades anything.": "已同意。在 #{m}（{n} 个区块后）成为规则；谁都不需要升级任何东西。",
  "Agreed. Becomes law at block #{x1}, {x2} block{x3} from now, estimated from the average time the last {x4} block{x5} took ({x6}).{x7}": "已同意。将在区块 #{x1} 成为法律，距今 {x2} 个区块，按最近 {x4} 个区块的平均用时（{x6}）估算。{x7}",
  "Agreed: validators vote with consensus_rule_vote transactions.": "同意：验证者用 consensus_rule_vote 交易投票。",
  "Agreed: validators vote with consensus_rule_vote transactions. The proposal is scheduled once the quorum policy is met, for example 2 of 3 validators. The quorum rule itself is part of the chain state, so it cannot be changed quietly.": "同意：验证者通过 consensus_rule_vote 交易投票。一旦满足法定票数策略（例如 3 个验证者中的 2 个），提案即被排期。法定票数规则本身也是链状态的一部分，因此无法被悄悄修改。",
  "Agreed: validators vote with consensus_rule_vote transactions. “{r}” has {a} of {b} needed votes (a majority of {c} validators). The quorum rule itself is part of the chain state, so it cannot be changed quietly.": "同意：验证者通过 consensus_rule_vote 交易投票。“{r}”已获得所需 {b} 票中的 {a} 票（{c} 个验证者的多数）。法定票数规则本身是链状态的一部分，因此无法被悄悄修改。",
  "Agreed: validators vote with consensus_rule_vote transactions. “{r}” has {a} of {b} needed votes (two thirds of {c} validators). The quorum rule itself is part of the chain state, so it cannot be changed quietly.": "同意：验证者通过 consensus_rule_vote 交易投票。“{r}”已获得所需 {b} 票中的 {a} 票（{c} 个验证者的三分之二）。法定票数规则本身是链状态的一部分，因此无法被悄悄修改。",
  "Agreed: validators vote with consensus_rule_vote transactions. “{x}” has {n} of {m} needed votes ({y} of {a} validators).": "同意：验证者用 consensus_rule_vote 交易投票。“{x}”已获得所需 {m} 票中的 {n} 票（{a} 个验证者的{y}）。",
  "Agreed: validators vote with transactions.": "同意：验证者用交易投票。",
  "Agreed: votes arrive as consensus_rule_vote transactions.": "同意：投票以 consensus_rule_vote 交易的形式到达。",
  "Agreed: votes arrive as consensus_rule_vote transactions. “{x}” has {n} of {m} needed votes ({y} of {a} validators).": "同意：投票以 consensus_rule_vote 交易的形式到达。“{x}”已获得所需 {m} 票中的 {n} 票（{a} 个验证者的{y}）。",
  "Agreed: votes arrive as transactions.": "同意：投票以交易的形式到达。",
  "Agreed: {x1} consensus_rule_vote transactions. “{x2}” has {x3} of {x4} needed votes ({x5} of {x6} validators).{x7} The quorum rule itself is part of the chain state, so it cannot be changed quietly.": "同意：{x1} consensus_rule_vote 交易。“{x2}”已获得所需 {x4} 票中的 {x3} 票（{x6} 个验证者的{x5}）。{x7} 法定票数规则本身是链状态的一部分，因此无法被悄悄修改。",
  "Agreed: “{x1}” activates at block #{x2}, in {x3} block{x4}. Until then the old rules apply.": "已同意：“{x1}”将在区块 #{x2}（{x3} 个区块后）生效。在此之前适用旧规则。",
