  "Any validator can propose a change, for example a new base fee, as an ordinary transaction that everyone can see. Follow the row “How a rule changes”: proposed, checked, agreed, active. Other chains need a fork and an upgrade. Tau needs agreement.": "任何验证者都可以提议变更，例如新的基础手续费，作为一笔所有人可见的普通交易。请看“规则如何改变”这一行：已提议、已检查、已同意、生效。其他链需要分叉和升级。Tau 需要的是同意。",
