  "At height {x1} the chain runs on spec revision {x2}: {x3} agreed rule change{x4} so far, {x5} open, {x6} account{x7} with their own money rules.": "在高度 {x1}，链运行在规范版本 {x2} 上：迄今 {x3} 项经同意的规则变更，{x5} 项待决，{x6} 个账户拥有自己的资金规则。",
