  "Average time the last {n} block took, from their own timestamps. Last block: {x}.": "最近 {n} 个区块的平均用时，按区块自身的时间戳计算。上一个区块：{x}。",
  "Average time the last {n} blocks took, from their own timestamps (i7). Last block: {x}.": "最近 {n} 个区块的平均用时，按区块自身的时间戳（i7）计算。上一个区块：{x}。",
  "Average time the last {n} blocks took, from their own timestamps. Last block: {x}.": "最近 {n} 个区块的平均用时，按区块自身的时间戳计算。上一个区块：{x}。",
  "Awaiting block": "等待区块",
  "Back": "上一步",
  "Back to the start: the HUD.": "回到起点：HUD。",
  "Background reading": "背景阅读",
  "Balances, the consensus rule program, the composite user-rule program, the validator set, pending governance and the quorum policy. Change any of them and the hash changes.": "余额、共识规则程序、组合用户规则程序、验证者集合、待决治理和法定票数策略。其中任何一项改变，哈希都会改变。",
  "Base fee": "基础手续费",
  "Base fee: {n} AGRS per transaction, emitted by consensus rule o9. It changes only through an agreed rule change, never by an admin.": "基础手续费：每笔交易 {n} AGRS，由共识规则 o9 输出。只能通过经同意的规则变更修改，绝不由管理员决定。",
  "Binds the account from now on, even with a stolen key": "从现在起约束该账户，即使密钥被盗也一样",
  "Binds the account, not the key; one guarded branch in the composite o5 program.": "约束的是账户，而不是密钥；是组合 o5 程序中的一个受保护分支。",
