  "Block #{n}, sealed {m} s ago under rule version {a}.": "区块 #{n}，{m} 秒前在规则版本 {a} 下封装。",
  "Block #{n}, sealed {m} s ago, judged under spec revision {a}.": "区块 #{n}，{m} 秒前封装，按规范版本 {a} 评判。",
  "Block check by rules": "按规则检查区块",
  "Block check by rules: a new block has to answer the active rules stream by stream. Is the proposer eligible? Is the fee paid? Is the signature valid? A block that fails any rule is refused, not patched.": "按规则检查区块：新区块必须逐个数据流回答当前生效的规则。提议者有资格吗？手续费付了吗？签名有效吗？任何一条规则不通过的区块都会被拒绝，而不是被修补。",
  "Block hash": "区块哈希",
  "block height": "区块高度",
