  "Block {n}": "区块 {n}",
  "block —": "区块 —",
  "Block-card and validator hovers cut to the essentials the card does not already show. The “block accepted” seal sits centred in its own space instead of hugging the corner.": "区块卡片和验证者的悬停说明只保留卡片上没有显示的要点。“区块已接受”印章居中放在自己的位置，而不是挤在角落。",
  "Blockchain": "区块链",
  "Blockchain strip scrolls like a film, and About says what a donation pays for": "区块链条带像胶片一样滚动，“关于”说明了捐助用在哪里",
  "Blockchain strip scrolls like a film, and About says what a donation pays for: the mouse wheel glides through the blocks instead of stopping at each one, the detail below follows the block at the right edge, and scrolling back keeps loading older blocks from the relay all the way to genesis; “back to newest” returns to the live end. The donation section is now “Keep it running”: what the project costs (mostly time), what a donation pays for, no banner, no pop-up. The thesis that resolves out of glyph noise on load now does it in phosphor green: brightest at the resolve front, dimmer further out, white once settled, and the paragraph no longer shifts while it resolves.": "区块链条带像胶片一样滚动，“关于”说明了捐助用在哪里：鼠标滚轮在区块间平滑滑动，不再逐块停顿，下方详情跟随最右边的区块，向回滚动会从中继一直加载更早的区块直到创世区块；“回到最新”返回实时末端。捐助部分现在叫“让它继续运行”：项目的成本（主要是时间）、捐助的用途，没有横幅，没有弹窗。页面加载时从字符噪声中浮现的主旨句现在使用荧光红：解析前沿最亮，越往外越暗，定形后变为白色，段落在解析过程中不再跳动。",
  "Blocks sealed (recent)": "封装的区块（最近）",
