  "No admin key": "没有管理员密钥",
  "no agreed change yet": "还没有已同意的变更",
  "No block was replaced by a competing branch, in the relay’s history or in this session.": "无论在中继的历史中还是本次会话中，都没有区块被竞争分支替换。",
  "No block was replaced by a competing branch, in the relay’s history or in this session. A reorg can run as deep as the common ancestor, up to a 2000-block path cap, because the alpha has no finality.": "在中继历史和本次会话中，没有区块被竞争分支替换。由于 alpha 版没有最终性，重组可以一直深入到共同祖先，最多 2000 个区块的路径上限。",
  "no change": "无变化",
