  "no connection": "无连接",
  "No connection to a node.": "未连接到节点。",
  "No fork, no upgrade, no admin.": "不分叉，不升级，没有管理员。",
  "no fork, no upgrade.": "不分叉，不升级。",
  "No open proposal to vote on": "没有可投票的未决提案",
  "No open proposal to vote on.": "没有可投票的提案。",
  "No own rule on this account; only the consensus checks applied.": "这个账户没有自己的规则；只适用共识检查。",
  "No own rule: every transfer is allowed.": "没有自有规则：每笔转账都允许。",
  "No personal rules yet. Each account can program its own transfer policy in Tau.": "还没有个人规则。每个账户都可以用 Tau 为自己的转账策略编程。",
  "No restart of the testnet on record.": "测试网没有重启记录。",
  "No restart of the testnet on record. A restart is a new chain on the same genesis; the relay flags it and the page starts over.": "没有测试网重启记录。重启是在同一创世区块上的一条新链；中继会标记它，页面随之重新开始。",
  "No rule change took effect in this block": "此区块中没有规则变更生效",
  "No rule changes proposed yet. Any active validator can propose one; it activates only after 3 of 4 agree.": "还没有提议任何规则变更。任何活跃验证者都可以提议；只有在 3 / 4 同意后才会生效。",
  "No rule changes proposed yet. Any active validator can propose one; it activates only after {n} of {x} agree.": "还没有人提议规则变更。任何活跃验证者都可以提议；只有 {x} 个中的 {n} 个同意后才会生效。",
  "No rule changes proposed yet. Any active validator can propose one; it activates only after {x} agree.": "还没有提议任何规则变更。任何活跃验证者都可以提议；只有在 {x} 同意后才会生效。",
  "No rules shared yet. Anyone can send a Tau rule to another account; the recipient reviews it and accepts or rejects it.": "还没有共享任何规则。任何人都可以把一条 Tau 规则发给另一个账户；接收方审阅后接受或拒绝。",
  "No signature, no block": "没有签名，就没有区块",
  "no switch on record": "无切换记录",
  "no switch so far": "迄今没有切换",
  "no transactions": "没有交易",
  "No transfer from this account checked yet.": "还没有检查过这个账户的转账。",
  "No validator data yet": "暂无验证者数据",
  "no vote": "未投票",
  "Nobody can change the rules alone. A change needs the validators’ agreement and takes effect at a later block.": "没有人能独自修改规则。变更需要验证者同意，并在之后的某个区块生效。",
  "Nobody has to upgrade anything.": "谁都不需要升级任何东西。",
  "Nobody runs it for this page; it just takes part in the network.": "没有人为本页运行它；它只是参与网络。",
  "Node log": "节点日志",
  "Node log · {x1} line{x2}": "节点日志 · {x1} 行",
  "Node log: the panel shows whole lines (time in its own column, nothing cut off) with more room, and a click opens the full log in the detail view, newest first, with counts of refusals and governance events. Chain core: every label (agreement, validators, “the agreed rules of everyone”) sits on a dark plate, so no ring crosses the letters. Detail views: every check chip (i10 signature, o6 block valid, o7 proposer eligible, o9 fee, o5 sender rule, the admission checks of a rule offer, the steps of a proposal) explains itself on hover. Live: when the relay reports a chain reset (the node discarded a chain the network abandoned), the page forgets the old blocks and rebuilds from the new ones.": "节点日志：面板显示完整的行（时间单独一列，不再截断），空间更大；点击会在详情视图中打开完整日志，最新的在前，并统计拒绝和治理事件。链核心：每个标签（共识、验证者、“所有人共同认可的规则”）都放在深色底板上，圆环不再穿过文字。详情视图：每个检查标签（i10 签名、o6 区块有效、o7 提议者有资格、o9 手续费、o5 发送方规则、规则提供的准入检查、提案的各个步骤）悬停时都有说明。实时：当中继报告链重置（节点丢弃了网络放弃的链）时，页面会忘掉旧区块，并从新区块重建。",
  "Node minimum: a rule change activates {x1} block{x2} or more after it is included. Block pace not measured yet.": "节点最低要求：规则变更在被打包后 {x1} 个或更多区块才生效。尚未测出出块节奏。",
  "Node minimum: a rule change activates {x1} block{x2} or more after it is included. The seconds count down to the next expected block{x3}": "节点最低要求：规则变更在被打包后 {x1} 个或更多区块才生效。秒数倒数到下一个预计区块{x3}",
  "Node minimum: a rule change activates {x1} block{x2} or more after it is included. {x3} × the average time the last {x4} block{x5} took ({x6}). The countdown is paused: the node is still catching up with the chain, or the chain is idle. A protocol minimum, not a measured average.": "节点最低要求：规则变更在被打包后 {x1} 个或更多区块才生效。{x3} × 最近 {x4} 个区块的平均用时（{x6}）。倒计时已暂停：节点仍在追赶链，或链处于空闲。这是协议最低要求，不是实测平均值。",
  "Node orbit: 1 node keeps a full copy of the chain and checks every block without sealing any: {x}.": "节点轨道：1 个节点保存完整的链副本并核验每个区块，但不封装任何区块：{x}。",
  "Node orbit: 1 non-sealing node: {x}.": "节点轨道：1 个不封装区块的节点：{x}。",
  "Node orbit: no nodes keep a full copy of the chain and check every block without sealing any.": "节点轨道：还没有只保存链的完整副本、检查每个区块而不封装的节点。",
  "Node orbit: no non-sealing nodes.": "节点轨道：没有不封装区块的节点。",
  "Node orbit: {n} node keeps a full copy of the chain and checks every block without sealing any: {x}.": "节点轨道：{n} 个节点保存链的完整副本并检查每个区块，但不封装任何区块：{x}。",
  "Node orbit: {n} nodes keep a full copy of the chain and check every block without sealing any: {x}.": "节点轨道：{n} 个节点保存链的完整副本并检查每个区块，但不封装任何区块：{x}。",
  "Node orbit: {n} non-sealing node: {x}.": "节点轨道：{n} 个不封装区块的节点：{x}。",
  "Node orbit: {n} non-sealing nodes: {x}.": "节点轨道：{n} 个不封装区块的节点：{x}。",
  "Nodes that only follow and check the chain sit on the orbit inside.": "只跟随并检查链的节点位于内侧的轨道上。",
  "Nodes: the board is never empty, joining takes three steps, and the page says what you get for running a node.": "节点：榜单永不为空，加入只需三步，页面说明运行节点能得到什么。",
  "Nodes: the page now counts every node on the network as our node sees it, IDNI’s bootnode included, not only the ones that run our kit; the <a href=\"stats/\">Stats</a> page says it too.": "节点：页面现在统计我们的节点在网络中看到的所有节点，包括 IDNI 的引导节点，而不只是运行我们套件的节点；<a href=\"stats/\">统计</a>页面也会显示。",
  "Nodes: the page now counts every node on the network as our node sees it, IDNI’s bootnode included, not only the ones that run our kit; the Stats page says it too.": "节点：页面现在统计我们的节点在网络中看到的所有节点，包括 IDNI 的引导节点，而不只是运行我们套件的节点；统计页面也会显示。",
  "Non-sealing nodes sit on the orbit inside.": "不封装区块的节点位于内侧的轨道上。",
