  "Not a matter of time: the open proposal needs {x1} vote{x2} (consensus_rule_vote) before it is scheduled. Proposing does not count as a vote.{x3} Only then does the activation height (#{x4}) start to matter.": "这不是时间问题：未决提案还需要 {x1} 票（consensus_rule_vote）才能排期。提议本身不算一票。{x3} 只有到那时，生效高度（#{x4}）才有意义。",
  "Not connected right now; met or heard of earlier.": "此刻未连接；之前遇到过或听说过。",
  "Not connected. The community relay may be down, or for your own node: 1) WebSocket port 65433 open, 2) TAU_WS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS includes this page’s origin, 3) address above correct, then Connect.": "未连接。社区中继可能已宕机；如果是你自己的节点：1）WebSocket 端口 65433 已开放，2）TAU_WS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS 包含本页的来源，3）上方地址正确，然后点击“连接”。",
  "Not enough agreement by #{n}; archived without effect.": "截至 #{n} 未获足够同意；已归档，无效。",
  "Not enough votes before the activation height: {n} of {m}. Archived without effect.": "在生效高度之前票数不足：{m} 票中只有 {n} 票。已存档且不生效。",
