  "Now binds {h}’s account": "现在约束 {h} 的账户",
  "Now binds {x1}’s account.": "现在约束 {x1} 的账户。",
  "Now binds {x}’s account.": "现在约束 {x} 的账户。",
  "o5 (sender policy)": "o5（发送方策略）",
  "o5 = 0: the sender’s own rule “{x}” refused it, whoever holds the key.": "o5 = 0：发送方自己的规则“{x}”拒绝了它，无论谁持有密钥。",
  "o5 = 1: the sender’s rule “{x}” checked this transfer and let it pass.": "o5 = 1：发送方的规则“{x}”检查了这笔转账并放行。",
  "o5 sender rule ✓": "o5 发送方规则 ✓",
  "o5 sender rule ✕": "o5 发送方规则 ✕",
  "o6 block valid ✓": "o6 区块有效 ✓",
  "o7 proposer eligible ✓": "o7 提议者有资格 ✓",
  "of the testnet, the moment our node sees one.": "测试网的链重启，我们的节点一发现就推送。",
  "Offer id": "提供 ID",
  "offered": "已提供",
  "Offerer": "提供方",
  "On most chains the code is the law and a few developers can change it. On Tau the rules are written in logic, every block is checked against them, and they change only when the validators agree. This tour shows where each part of that happens.": "在大多数链上，代码就是法律，少数开发者就能修改它。在 Tau 上，规则用逻辑写成，每个区块都要接受它们的检查，而且只有验证者同意时规则才会改变。本导览展示这一切分别在哪里发生。",
  "On other chains, code is law. On Tau, the agreement is law: users write the rules in logic, every rule is checked before it can apply, and nothing changes without the validators’ consent. There is no admin key.": "在其他链上，代码即法律。在 Tau 上，共识即法律：用户用逻辑写规则，每条规则在生效前都要经过检查，未经验证者同意，什么都不会改变。没有管理员密钥。",
  "On Tau a rule change is a transaction: checked, agreed by quorum and live a few blocks later.": "在 Tau 上，规则变更就是一笔交易：经过检查、由法定票数同意，几个区块后生效。",
  "On this network any account may vote (open governance admission); the threshold comes from the validator count.": "在这个网络上，任何账户都可以投票（开放的治理准入）；阈值来自验证者数量。",
  "on wide screens the column has the full height, laptops show every panel whole and scroll. The Simple/Technical switch appears only on pages where it changes something.": "宽屏上该列占满整个高度，笔记本电脑上每个面板完整显示并可滚动。“简洁/技术”切换只出现在会产生变化的页面上。",
  "one account offers a rule, the other checks it and accepts or rejects": "一个账户提供规则，另一个账户检查后接受或拒绝",
  "One account sends a Tau rule to another. The recipient reads it, runs a conflict report (shape, reserved streams, bit widths, does it compile together with the rules already in force) and then accepts it into their own specification or rejects it. Accepting replaces the recipient’s current rule on that stream.": "一个账户把一条 Tau 规则发给另一个账户。接收方阅读它，运行冲突报告（结构、保留数据流、位宽、能否与已生效规则一起编译），然后把它接受进自己的规范，或拒绝它。接受会替换接收方在该数据流上的现有规则。",
  "One of {n} validators; {m} must agree to change a rule.": "{n} 个验证者之一；改变一条规则需要 {m} 个同意。",
  "one type scale and one spacing scale on the HUD, this log shows one line per version with the details folded away, and a search field in the header (⌘K or Ctrl+K) sends a block number, hash or address to the Explorer. Design pass on all pages: Feedback in the footer, compact phone header, offline states, one type scale, readable line length; Telegram posts lead with why it matters.": "HUD 使用统一的字号阶梯和间距阶梯，本日志每个版本只显示一行，细节折叠起来，页眉新增搜索框（⌘K 或 Ctrl+K），可把区块号、哈希或地址发送到区块浏览器。所有页面的设计调整：页脚的反馈入口、紧凑的手机页眉、离线状态、统一字号、易读的行宽；Telegram 推送先说明为什么重要。",
  "Only node besides the IDNI validator (PoA, validator_set mode): the two are the whole visible network right now.": "IDNI 验证者（PoA，validator_set 模式）之外唯一的节点：此刻这两个就是整个可见网络。",
