  "Outer rim: the consensus spec, revision {n} (o6 block validity, o7 proposer eligibility, o9 fee = {m} AGRS).": "外圈：共识规范，版本 {n}（o6 区块有效性，o7 提议者资格，o9 手续费 = {m} AGRS）。",
  "Outer rim: the consensus spec, revision {n} (o6 block validity, o7 proposer eligibility, o9 fee = {m} AGRS). Amended {a} time by agreement. It encloses everything inside: validators sit on it, rule accounts and the mempool orbit within it, and every block is judged by it.": "外圈：共识规范，版本 {n}（o6 区块有效性、o7 提议者资格、o9 手续费 = {m} AGRS）。经共识修订 {a} 次。它包含内部的一切：验证者位于其上，规则账户和内存池在其中运行，每个区块都按它评判。",
  "Outer rim: the consensus spec, revision {n} (o6 block validity, o7 proposer eligibility, o9 fee = {m} AGRS). Amended {a} times by agreement. It encloses everything inside: validators sit on it, rule accounts and the mempool orbit within it, and every block is judged by it.": "外圈：共识规范，版本 {n}（o6 区块有效性、o7 提议者资格、o9 手续费 = {m} AGRS）。经共识修订 {a} 次。它包含内部的一切：验证者位于其上，规则账户和内存池在其中运行，每个区块都按它评判。",
  "Outer rim: the consensus spec, revision {n}. It encloses everything inside: validators sit on it, rule accounts and the mempool orbit within it, and every block is judged by it.": "外圈：共识规范，版本 {n}。它包含内部的一切：验证者位于其上，规则账户和内存池在其中运行，每个区块都按它评判。",
  "Outer rim: the consensus spec, revision {x1}. It encloses everything inside: validators sit on it, rule accounts and the mempool orbit within it, and every block is judged by it.": "外环：共识规范，版本 {x1}。它包围其内的一切：验证者坐落其上，规则账户和内存池在其内运行，每个区块都由它评判。",
  "Outer rim: the rule book everyone agreed to, version {n}. Everything inside obeys it: validators sit on it, accounts and waiting transactions orbit within it, and every block is checked against it.": "外圈：所有人共同认可的规则手册，版本 {n}。里面的一切都遵守它：验证者位于其上，账户和等待中的交易在其中运行，每个区块都要对照它检查。",
  "Output: for each transfer, does the sender’s own personal rule allow it? 0 means the node refuses it, whoever holds the key.": "输出：对每笔转账，发送方自己的个人规则是否允许？0 表示节点拒绝它，无论谁持有密钥。",
  "Output: is the block valid? Equals the signature check, so an unsigned block is rejected by the rules themselves.": "输出：区块是否有效？等于签名检查结果，因此未签名的区块会被规则本身拒绝。",
  "Output: may this proposer seal the block? 1 = eligible under the current validator rules.": "输出：这个提议者可以封装这个区块吗？1 = 在当前验证者规则下有资格。",
  "Output: the base fee every transaction pays, in AGRS. Changed only by agreed rule change.": "输出：每笔交易支付的基础手续费，单位 AGRS。只能通过经同意的规则变更修改。",
  "pages; a block’s full detail links to the rules in force at that height. Rule changes by agreement: when an agreed change was scheduled far ahead by the proposal itself, the Tau row says so (“at #5028”, “agreed in n blocks”) instead of counting down the proposer’s wait as if it were Tau’s speed. Block detail: when the full detail would need scrolling at your screen size, a one-glance summary takes its place and a click opens the full detail. Every detail window scrolls inside the screen. Screens up to 900 px tall get the scrolling layout.": "页面；区块的完整详情链接到该高度上生效的规则。经共识的规则变更：当已通过的变更由提案本身安排在很远的未来时，Tau 一行会如实显示（“于 #5028”、“n 个区块内通过”），而不是把提议者选择的等待时间当作 Tau 的速度来倒计时。区块详情：如果完整详情在你的屏幕上需要滚动，就先显示一目了然的摘要，点击后打开完整详情。每个详情窗口都在屏幕内滚动。高度不超过 900 px 的屏幕使用可滚动布局。",
  "Peer of our node": "我们节点的对等节点",
