  "Peer of our node: tip {n}": "我们节点的对等节点：最新高度 {n}",
  "People looking at Tau HUD right now. Counted by the community read relay at node.tauhud.com, which every open HUD talks to; no cookies, no analytics, nobody is identified; a random token in your browser makes sure you count once, even with several tabs or pages open. “—” means the relay has not answered yet.": "此刻正在浏览 Tau HUD 的人数。由 node.tauhud.com 上的社区只读中继统计，每个打开的 HUD 都连接它；不用 Cookie、不做分析、不识别任何人；浏览器中的一个随机令牌确保你只被计一次，即使开了多个标签页或页面。“—”表示中继尚未应答。",
  "Personal money rules": "个人资金规则",
  "Personal money rules ({x1})": "个人资金规则（{x1}）",
  "Personal money rules: the examples now show what Tau itself advertises: a second approval above an amount (the transfer parks as an approval request and executes when the approver signs, with a countdown in blocks), a lock until a block height instead of a clock time, spending limits, whitelists and co-signatures. Live mode shows approval requests only when the node reports them. Validators: the consensus mode (fixed validator list, list in Tau logic, or stake-based) and how often it was switched by agreement. Blockchain: a fork radar counting reorgs (with depth) and testnet restarts.": "个人资金规则：示例现在展示 Tau 自己宣传的功能：超过某个金额时需要第二次审批（转账作为审批请求暂存，审批人签名后执行，并以区块数倒计时）、锁定到某个区块高度而不是时钟时间、消费限额、白名单和共同签名。实时模式只在节点报告时显示审批请求。验证者：共识模式（固定验证者列表、Tau 逻辑中的列表或基于质押）以及经共识切换过多少次。区块链：分叉雷达统计重组（含深度）和测试网重启。",
  "Personal rule · {x1}": "个人规则 · {x1}",
  "Personal rule · {x}": "个人规则 · {x}",
  "Phone layout: compact header (name, view switch, one-line notice, swipeable status chips, main buttons plus a More menu), reading order core → rule changes → rules in force → blocks → detail, comparison rows wrap with every word readable, tap-to-explain works reliably, block details stay short.": "手机布局：紧凑的页眉（名称、视图切换、一行提示、可滑动的状态标签、主要按钮和“更多”菜单），阅读顺序为 核心 → 规则变更 → 生效规则 → 区块 → 详情；对比行换行，每个字都可读；点按查看说明稳定可用；区块详情保持简短。",
  "Phones and tablets: header chips wrap instead of scrolling sideways, panel subtitles, provenance lines and block values wrap instead of being cut off, the chain core uses the full width, a tap on a button no longer leaves a tooltip behind. Desktop: the “from the protocol / seen on the testnet” lines under the thesis cards wrap instead of being cut off.": "手机和平板：页眉标签改为换行而不是横向滚动；面板副标题、来源行和区块数值改为换行而不是被截断；链核心使用全部宽度；点按按钮后不再残留提示框。桌面：主旨卡片下方“来自协议文档 / 已在测试网上看到”的行改为换行而不是被截断。",
  "Plain ws:// is not allowed from an https page; using wss:// instead.": "https 页面不允许使用普通 ws://；改用 wss://。",
  "Playground: a visible “Check rule” run with a softer engine limit, refused checks in a muted red, hover and click explain each check, and on the validator seat proposals are the obvious first step.": "Playground：可见的“Check rule”运行过程和更宽松的引擎限制，被拒绝的检查用柔和的绿色显示，悬停和点击可解释每项检查；在验证者席位上，提案是显而易见的第一步。",
  "PoA · {n}": "权威证明 · {n}",
  "Press": "新闻资料",
  "Press kit under Learn": "“了解”下新增媒体资料包",
  "Press kit under Learn: a ready paragraph, the facts, the 60 second video in three formats, the logo for dark and light, screenshots and a ZIP of everything. Design pass, part one: red is reserved for offline and down, refusals and the fork step are white with ✕ or a strike; fewer boxes inside Rule changes; panel subtitles in sentence case, instructions moved into the (i) hover; Rules in force now shows revision and fee large and the rest as one sentence; header chips show the value only, the name is in the hover, and a new Consensus chip says who seals blocks; validator keys in the chain state are short with a copy button; the background rain is off unless you switch it on.": "“了解”下新增媒体资料包：现成的介绍段落、事实数据、三种格式的 60 秒视频、深色和浅色版标志、截图以及全部内容的 ZIP。设计调整第一部分：绿色只用于离线和故障，拒绝和分叉步骤用白色加 ✕ 或删除线表示；“规则变更”内部的框更少；面板副标题使用句子格式，操作说明移入 (i) 悬停提示；“当前生效的规则”以大字显示版本和手续费，其余用一句话概括；页眉标签只显示数值，名称放在悬停提示中，新的“共识”标签说明谁在封装区块；链状态中的验证者密钥缩短显示并带复制按钮；背景字符雨默认关闭，需手动开启。",
  "Previous block": "前一个区块",
  "proposal tracker": "提案追踪",
  "Proposal wording matches the Proposals page": "提案用语与“提案”页面一致",
  "Proposal wording matches the Proposals page: “waiting for votes” and “agreed, takes effect soon” in the Chain state detail and validator history, instead of “collecting agreement” and “scheduled”.": "提案用语与“提案”页面一致：链状态详情和验证者历史中使用“等待投票”和“已同意，即将生效”，不再用“收集同意”和“已排期”。",
  "Proposals, votes, scheduling and activation of rule changes.": "规则变更的提案、投票、排期和生效。",
  "Proposals: a new page at": "提案：新页面",
  "Proposals: a new page at /proposals/ tracks every rule change and offers Telegram, X and RSS alerts; linked from the header, and the feedback panel links the Telegram channel.": "提案：新页面 /proposals/ 跟踪每一项规则变更，并提供 Telegram、X 和 RSS 提醒；可从页眉进入，反馈面板也链接了 Telegram 频道。",
  "Proposals: a new page at {e1} tracks every rule change and offers Telegram, X and RSS alerts; linked from the header, and the feedback panel links the Telegram channel.": "提案：新页面 {e1} 跟踪每一项规则变更，并提供 Telegram、X 和 RSS 提醒；可从页眉进入，反馈面板也链接了 Telegram 频道。",
  "Proposals: the detail sits in two columns so it fits without scrolling.": "提案：详情分两栏显示，无需滚动。",
  "propose": "提议",
  "Propose: any active validator sends a consensus_rule_update transaction with the new rule text or validator patch. It is an ordinary transaction, visible to everyone, with an activation height a few blocks ahead.": "提议：任何活跃验证者发送一笔 consensus_rule_update 交易，附上新的规则文本或验证者补丁。这是一笔普通交易，所有人可见，生效高度设在几个区块之后。",
  "Proposed at": "提议于",
  "Proposed by": "提议者",
  "proposed → checked → agreed → scheduled → active": "已提议 → 已检查 → 已同意 → 已排期 → 生效",
  "proposed: {r}": "已提议：{r}",
  "Proposer": "提议者",
  "proposer eligibility": "提议者资格",
  "proposer identity": "提议者身份",
  "proposer {h}": "提议者 {h}",
