  "Spec revision {n}: how many times the consensus rules have changed by agreement (genesis = 1). Click to see every rule in force right now.": "规范版本 {n}：共识规则经同意修改的次数（创世 = 1）。点击查看当前生效的所有规则。",
  "Spending limit": "消费限额",
  "Spending limit: blocks transfers above {x}; anything above is refused by the account itself": "消费限额：阻止超过 {x} 的转账；超出部分由账户自身拒绝",
  "Spending limit: {x}; anything above is refused by the account itself.": "消费限额：{x}；超出部分由账户本身拒绝。",
