  "“always” means the rule holds at every block, forever, until changed by agreement": "“始终”表示该规则在每个区块都成立，永远有效，直到经同意被修改",
  "“How a rule changes”: one proposal at a time, so every run starts at propose and each step lights up in real time. The Tau row now ends under “vote”; fork, splits and upgrading by hand belong to the other chains only. The “length = time” caption is gone.": "“规则如何改变”：一次只显示一个提案，所以每一轮都从提议开始，每一步实时点亮。Tau 一行现在止于“投票”下方；分叉、分裂和手动升级只属于其他链。“长度 = 时间”的说明已移除。",
  "“Last at” names the block where the newest rule was deployed.": "“最近一次在”指最新规则部署所在的区块。",
  "“Oldest” counts from when this page first saw the transaction.": "“最久”从本页第一次看到该交易时开始计算。",
  "“waiting for votes” and “agreed, takes effect soon” in the Chain state detail and validator history, instead of “collecting agreement” and “scheduled”.": "链状态详情和验证者历史中使用“等待投票”和“已同意，即将生效”，不再用“收集同意”和“已排期”。",
