  "“{x1}” contradicts the live spec · never reached the chain": "“{x1}”与现行规范矛盾 · 从未进入链上",
  "“{x1}” is agreed. Its activation height #{x2} was chosen by the proposal itself, {x3} blocks ahead{x4}": "“{x1}”已获同意。其生效高度 #{x2} 由提案自身选定，在 {x3} 个区块之后{x4}",
  "“{x}”: agreed ✓.": "“{x}”：已同意 ✓。",
  "“{x}”: not voted yet.": "“{x}”：尚未投票。",
  "“{x}”: not voting on this one.": "“{x}”：不参与这次投票。",
  "• A block is valid (o6) only if the host verified the proposer’s BLS signature (i10)": "• 只有当主机验证了提议者的 BLS 签名（i10）时，区块才有效（o6）",
  "• A block is valid (o6) only if the host verified the proposer’s BLS signature (i10). No signature, no block.": "• 只有当主机验证了提议者的 BLS 签名（i10）时，区块才有效（o6）。没有签名，就没有区块。",
  "• A block is valid only if the host verified the proposer’s BLS signature. No signature, no block.": "• 只有当主机验证了提议者的 BLS 签名时，区块才有效。没有签名，就没有区块。",
  "• Every transaction costs {n} AGRS (o9), paid to the proposer": "• 每笔交易花费 {n} AGRS（o9），支付给提议者",
  "• Every transaction costs {n} AGRS (o9), paid to the proposer.": "• 每笔交易花费 {n} AGRS（o9），付给提议者。",
  "• Every transaction costs {n} AGRS, paid to the proposer.": "• 每笔交易花费 {n} AGRS，付给提议者。",
  "• Every validator in the set is currently eligible to propose (o7 = 1)": "• 集合中的每个验证者目前都有资格提议（o7 = 1）",
  "• Every validator in the set is currently eligible to propose (o7 = 1).": "• 集合中的每个验证者目前都有资格提议区块（o7 = 1）。",
  "• Every validator in the set is currently eligible to propose.": "• 集合中的每个验证者目前都有资格提议区块。",
