  "A creature on the live testnet that grows when people feed it real transactions.": "实时测试网上的一只小生物，大家用真实交易喂它，它就会长大。",
  "Watch: no answer from agorzilla.com right now.": "注意：agorzilla.com 目前没有回应。",
