  "Agreement ring: it fills clockwise as validators agree to a change.": "共识环：验证者同意某项变更时，它会顺时针填满。",
  "Visitors’ vote: {x}? {n} yes, {m} no.": "访客投票：{x}？{n} 票赞成，{m} 票反对。",
  "Closes {x} UTC; the simulated validators follow the majority. Vote in the simulation bar.": "{x} UTC 截止；模拟验证者会听从多数。请在模拟栏中投票。",
  "Visitors’ vote, closed: {n} yes, {m} no.": "访客投票已结束：{n} 票赞成，{m} 票反对。",
